OL,3,AThe Grand Tour's new presenters: 'I
OL,4,Ahope we prove the critics wrong'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than two decades, Top Gear and
OL,7,FThe Grand Tour were defined as much by
OL,8,Fthe three men presenting them as by the
OL,9,Fcars they drove.
OL,11,FJeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond and
OL,12,FJames May built one of television's
OL,13,Fmost recognisable partnerships, meaning
OL,14,Fanyone taking over The Grand Tour was
OL,15,Falways going to face a daunting task.
OL,17,FNow YouTubers James Engelsman and
OL,18,FThomas Holland and, perhaps most
OL,19,Funexpectedly, train
OL,20,Fenthusiast-turned-internet star Francis
OL,21,FBourgeois are stepping into their shoes
OL,22,Ffor the new series.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
