OL,3,AThe Grand Tour's new presenters: 'I
OL,4,Ahope we prove the critics wrong'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd, with initial reviews generally
OL,7,Fmixed, they knew they had some
OL,8,Fconvincing to do.
